---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { catalog, tenThousandKrwCny } from '../data/catalog';
const { title='首尔价研所 · 韩国轻医美公开价格比较', active='' } = Astro.props;
const fxSample = tenThousandKrwCny();
const rawCount = catalog.raw_options?.length || 0;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="面向中国顾客的首尔皮肤科轻医美公开活动价比价平台。按设备、品牌分档与发数/毫升拆解单价，中韩对照可核验。" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">跳到主要内容</a>
    <div class="top-ribbon">
      <div class="shell top-ribbon-inner">
        <div class="top-ribbon-left">
          <span class="ribbon-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>只收录公开标价 · 不代预约、不收款 · 标价与新客券分开展示</span>
        </div>
        <div class="top-ribbon-right">
          {fxSample ? (
            <span>参考汇率 <b>₩10,000 ≈ ¥{fxSample}</b>（{catalog.rate?.date}）</span>
          ) : (
            <span>汇率待更新</span>
          )}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="shell nav-bar">
        <a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="首尔价研所首页">
          <span class="brand-logo" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
              <path d="M6.5 17.5L12 5.5L17.5 17.5" stroke="#FAF8F6" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="14.5" r="2.3" fill="#E05286"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="brand-text">
            <strong>首尔价研所</strong>
            <small>SEOUL PRICE LAB</small>
          </span>
        </a>

        <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="主导航">
          <a class:list={['nav-link', active === 'home' && 'is-active']} href="/">十项比价</a>
          <a class:list={['nav-link', active === 'activities' && 'is-active']} href="/activities/">
            全部活动{rawCount ? <span class="nav-count">{rawCount}</span> : null}
          </a>
          <a class:list={['nav-link', active === 'report' && 'is-active']} href="/report/">价格解读</a>
          <a class:list={['nav-link', active === 'about' && 'is-active']} href="/about/">比价说明</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="nav-meta">
          <span class="city-pill">
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
            首尔 · 10类轻医美
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main"><slot /></main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="shell footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-col-brand">
          <a href="/" class="footer-logo">
            <span class="brand-logo brand-logo-sm" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M6.5 17.5L12 5.5L17.5 17.5" stroke="#FAF8F6" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="14.5" r="2.4" fill="#E05286"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>首尔价研所</span>
          </a>
          <p>把韩国皮肤科公开活动拆成同规格中文清单，让每发、每毫升、每次的价格回到同一把尺子。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col-links">
          <h4>浏览导航</h4>
          <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="/">十项轻医美总览</a>
            <a href="/activities/">全部实采活动（{rawCount}）</a>
            <a href="/report/">价格观察室</a>
            <a href="/about/">计算规则与下架联系</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col-note">
          <h4>核验与免责声明</h4>
          <p>本站仅整理韩国公开平台标价，不提供医疗建议，不展示患者评价或照片。外国人是否同价及到院最终费用请直接向医院确认。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="shell footer-bottom">
        <span>SEOUL PRICE LAB © 2026</span>
        <span>无医院竞价排名 · 价格与分位数均由代码计算</span>
        <span>中文为 AI 辅助翻译 · 点击任意条目可核对韩文原文</span>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
      document.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {
        const btn = (e.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-copy]');
        if (!btn) return;
        const text = btn.dataset.copy || '';
        if (!text || !navigator.clipboard) return;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
          const prev = btn.textContent || '复制韩文信息';
          btn.textContent = '已复制 ✓';
          btn.dataset.copied = 'true';
          setTimeout(() => {
            btn.textContent = prev;
            delete btn.dataset.copied;
          }, 1600);
        } catch {}
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
